            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>2</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod bu haliyle <code>2</code> görüntüler. Hangi tek değişiklik bunun yerine <code>4</code> görüntülenmesini sağlar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Koşulu <code>counter &lt; 4</code> olarak değiştir.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter += 1</code> ifadesini <code>counter += 4</code> olarak değiştir.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter = 1</code> ifadesini <code>counter = 0</code> olarak değiştir.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koşulu <code>counter &lt; 4</code> olarak değiştir.</p></body></html>",
